title: Alianza Obrera
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1 and iron_front_timer = 0
on-arrival: iron_front_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; ugt_militia_cost = 2 if ugt_militia_militancy > 0.15 else ugt_militia_cost = 1; ugt_militia_cost = 3 if ugt_militia_militancy > 0.3
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= Alianza Obrera

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Alianza Obrera**</span> (Workers' Alliance) is our anti-fascist coordination front, uniting the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>, the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, and the militia. How should we use it?

[? if industrial_psoe < 45 or industrial_psoe < industrial_falange or industrial_psoe < industrial_pce : Unfortunately, the Alianza's effectiveness is dragged down by the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s unpopularity, as it is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many militia members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the <span style="color: #003755;">CEDA</span>/<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Falange</span> right with the militia.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against militarism and colonial war.
- @republic: Rally to save the democratic republic against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span>.
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ ugt_militia_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= ugt_militia_cost
on-arrival: resources -= ugt_militia_cost; ugt_militia_strength += 50; ugt_militia_militancy += 0.05; ceda_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; izq_rep_relation -= 3 if strife < 5

The Alianza Obrera rallies for the militant defense of the republic against the <span style="color: #003755;">CEDA</span>/<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Falange</span> right, strengthening the militia.

[? if strife < 5: The <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> decries the militarization of the Alianza, uneasy about its growing independence. ?][? if strife >= 5: Seeing the strife that has filled Spain's streets, the <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> and <span style="color: #d9a441;">Radicals</span> seem to be convinced that it is necessary, and mute their criticisms. ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; industrial_psoe += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; urban_middle_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4

The Alianza Obrera rallies against militarism and the colonial war in Morocco.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; unemployed_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; urban_middle_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

The Alianza Obrera rallies in defense of the democratic republic and against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span>.
